        "Title": "Caloric Catastrophe",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102956082935",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository d5220463-43ca-4d48-a5b5-3b4825713bda).Image",
        "Description": "Diana found that Agent 47, on his recent &quot;vacation,&quot; did nothing except for bed rot, doom scroll, and eat an absolutely absurd amount of sweets and genetically modified, high-calorie snacks. Diana had a word with the ICA and they&apos;ve curated a contract for Agent 47 in hopes of burning off some of those uneccesary calories. If Agent 47 fails to get back in shape, he may be let go of the program entirely. Help Agent 47 keep his job and put them steppers to work.",
